      "content": "idk i dont know if i can keep \"showing up\" forever. it's just exhausting. like, if i stopped going out or stopped trying, would anyone even notice i was gone? it feels like the world would just keep spinning exactly the same way without me. it's almost like i'm already gone, just stuck in this weird waiting room.",
